 "lyrics": [
  {
   "start": 17.85,
   "end": 19.73,
   "text": "Stay awake at night"
  },
  {
   "start": 20.66,
   "end": 22.14,
   "text": "Wondering how could I"
  },
  {
   "start": 22.91,
   "end": 24.47,
   "text": "Let it get this way"
  },
  {
   "start": 27.67,
   "end": 29.01,
   "text": "Through all the pain"
  },
  {
   "start": 29.74,
   "end": 31.11,
   "text": "I took all the blame"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.71,
   "end": 33.45,
   "text": "While you cursed my last name"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.87,
   "end": 37.98,
   "text": "I thought we could get better"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.52,
   "end": 40.3,
   "text": "Stay committed like a soldier"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.77,
   "end": 42.39,
   "text": "Believed we're okay"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.8,
   "end": 53.05,
   "text": "Now I know that you don't care at all"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.89,
   "end": 62.66,
   "text": "Time wasted, gave all of my soul and my heart to someone that would never"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.55,
   "end": 63.01,
   "text": "give me the same"
  },
  {
   "start": 63.15,
   "end": 70.11,
   "text": "I was a fool to believe that you would finally be the one to"
  },
  {
   "start": 70.44,
   "end": 71.88,
   "text": "give me the same"
  },
  {
   "start": 71.74,
   "end": 75.59,
   "text": "Heartbroken now"
  },
  {
   "start": 76.19,
   "end": 80.51,
   "text": "How you let me down"
  },
  {
   "start": 80.6,
   "end": 88.24,
   "text": "But somehow, deep down I still do love you"
  },
  {
   "start": 132.16,
   "end": 133.9,
   "text": "Now you're out all night"
  },
  {
   "start": 134.81,
   "end": 136.04,
   "text": "Telling your lies"
  },
  {
   "start": 136.46,
   "end": 138.24,
   "text": "About the way I hurt you"
  },
  {
   "start": 139.06,
   "end": 140.73,
   "text": "They couldn't see the way"
  },
  {
   "start": 140.91,
   "end": 142.84,
   "text": "You made me feel ashamed"
  },
  {
   "start": 143.65,
   "end": 145.32,
   "text": "For choosing to love you"
  },
  {
   "start": 147.7,
   "end": 150.0,
   "text": "I began to see clearer"
  },
  {
   "start": 150.36,
   "end": 152.27,
   "text": "That you were just a liar"
  },
  {
   "start": 152.73,
   "end": 154.38,
   "text": "Stuck in your ways"
  },
  {
   "start": 155.87,
   "end": 165.13,
   "text": "So now I choose to walk away forever"
  },
  {
   "start": 165.62,
   "end": 174.16,
   "text": "Time wasted, gave all of my soul and my heart to someone that would never"
  },
  {
   "start": 173.45,
   "end": 175.0,
   "text": "give me the same"
  },
  {
   "start": 175.05,
   "end": 182.13,
   "text": "I was a fool to believe that you would finally be the one to"
  },
  {
   "start": 182.39,
   "end": 183.73,
   "text": "give me the same"
  },
  {
   "start": 183.73,
   "end": 187.45,
   "text": "Heartbroken now"
  },
  {
   "start": 188.14,
   "end": 191.97,
   "text": "How you let me down"
  },
  {
   "start": 192.41,
   "end": 199.93,
   "text": "But somehow, deep down I still do love you"
  },
  {
   "start": 200.62,
   "end": 205.58,
   "text": "How could you just throw it all away"
  },
  {
   "start": 209.63,
   "end": 215.17,
   "text": "I stayed with you through all the lies and pain, oh"
  },
  {
   "start": 218.59,
   "end": 223.28,
   "text": "Tears roll down my eyes"
  },
  {
   "start": 223.38,
   "end": 225.37,
   "text": "As I now realize"
  },
  {
   "start": 226.47,
   "end": 233.42,
   "text": "Your love was never truly mine"
  }
 ],
